{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262dePxw0KOI1795819492.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>九巴母公司載通國際發盈警。</p><p></p><p>預計截至今年12月底止，全年基礎盈利按年下跌約五成至六成半，主要由於國際燃油價格急劇飈升所致。去年同期基礎盈利約5.4億元。公司上半年投資物業公平價值，虧損約1.2億元，至於全年公平價值變動則須進一步評估。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:24:16.480950+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T22:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:33:59.030718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:17:35.364490+00:00","content_hash":"d5164519734444470fe59a05530db3a99572791fa578953744752974c9a00ed9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:24:16.480950+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}